  "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore(deps): update dependency eslint to v10.9.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/32\n* fix: style WorkflowViewer current node based on terminal instance status by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/37\n* chore(deps): update dependency @xyflow/react to v12.11.5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/12\n* chore(deps): update dependency @types/react-dom to v19.2.5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/13\n* chore(deps): update dependency typescript-eslint to v8.68.0 - autoclosed by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/34\n* chore(deps): update dependency eslint to v10.9.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/33\n* chore(deps): update dependency node to v24.20.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/35\n* Fix completeCurrentNode ignoring FAILED/PENDING NodeResult status by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/39\n* feat(ui): host-augmentable right-click context menu for WorkflowViewer nodes by @EricWittmann in https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/pull/42\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Apitomy/apitomy-flow/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.2",
